  "text": "## Purpose & Scope  \n### Purpose  \nTo establish procedures for operational risk management that:\n- Identify operational risks proactively\n- Assess risk impact and likelihood\n- Implement mitigation controls\n- Monitor risk metrics\n- Report to senior management and Board",
